@startuml
title USB route state machine

[*] --> Idle
Idle --> Probing : VBUS confirmed
Probing --> Active : fresh mount
Probing --> Idle : timeout
Probing --> Idle : VBUS absent
Probing --> Idle : USB disabled
Active --> Idle : VBUS absent
Active --> Idle : configuration lost

state Idle
state Probing
state Active

note right of Probing
  USB is presented,
  but the route is not yet adopted.
end note

note right of Active
  The transition closes the state
  of the previous route.
end note
@enduml
